+// not yet ported the rename does not break silently between an
+// `ui-kit:update` and its own migration.
+//
+// Convention for every entry:
+//   // @deprecated <old-selector> — renamed to <new-selector> in <Task Id>.
+//   //   Removed in Stage B4. Tracked in agent-migration-guide.md
+//   //   "Реестр алиасов миграции".
+//   .<old-selector> {
+//     @extend .<new-selector>;
+//   }
+// An alias forwards to the current rule (`@extend`, or a duplicated
+// declaration list when `@extend` would cross an incompatible selector
+// context) — it never carries its own new styling. Keep this section's own
+// registry entry (agent-migration-guide.md) in sync with every addition and
+// removal.
